<title>USA: Pricellular Q4 subscribers additions rise.</title>
<headline>Pricellular Q4 subscribers additions rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pricellular Corp Tuesday said it recorded an increase in subscriber additions of 40 percent, or 21,600, in the 1996 fourth quarter, against one year ago.</p>
<p>The company ended the year with 150,000 subscribers, an increase in net subscribers added of 110 percent versus 1995.</p>
